direction: right
Commit: "Commit / MR" { style.fill: "#fee2e2"; style.stroke: "#b91c1c" }
CI: "Build + test" { style.fill: "#dbeafe"; style.stroke: "#2563eb" }
CD: "Deploy" { style.fill: "#dcfce7"; style.stroke: "#16a34a" }
Prod: "Environment" { style.fill: "#ffedd5"; style.stroke: "#ea580c" }
Commit -> CI -> CD -> Prod
